# Repository text is LF on every platform. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would
# otherwise give CRLF working trees: CRLF in Docker build contexts, in scripts copied to the NAS, and in the
# migration files whose SHA-256 values are recorded in docs/operations.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
